## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F1 | open | IMPORTANT | js/common/wipSquash.js | ⚠️ important wip re s new alternative matches a message format this repo never generates js common wipsquash js 11 extends the wip subject regex to wip auto save wip partial analysis interrupted run and the new test walkbackcontiguouswipbase walks across interrupted partial work commits too walks across the subject proj 1 wip partial analysis interrupted run nothing in this repo produces that message the interrupted partial work commit is created by pushpartialwork developbugandcreatepr js 544 from the formats commitmessage wip template whose default js configloader js 102 js config js 212 renders as proj 123 wip partial analysis agent interrupted wip re test proj 123 wip partial analysis agent interrupted → false colon after wip agent interrupted ≠ interrupted run consequence walkbackcontiguouswipbase — used by resolvepersistedbasehead at setup and by resolveinplacebasesha when dev base head txt is missing unreadable — still stops at a real partial analysis commit so the base walk back across interrupted partial work the exact gh 1501 gap this alternative was added for does not happen under default config reproduced on this branch with the real default template walked to expect 0000000 if fix worked ccccccc head itself — no walk fix match the real default e g wip auto save wip partial analysis or derive the pattern from the configured formats commitmessage wip template and correct the new test subject to the rendered default message |
| F2 | open | SUGGESTION | js/developTicketAndCreatePR.js | 🪶 nit orphaned comment fragment inserting the squash call replaced the first line of the gh 1087 comment block leaving a sentence that now starts mid thought javascript function resetinterrupteddevelopment ctx commentbody squashnonpublishwipcommits ctx of resetting for retry — resetting here would re dispatch the same leg into the same exhausted provider chain on the next sm tick per tick restore the lead line e g gh 1087 ac1 ac2 a hard provider quota failure parks the lane instead above the new call so the comment reads whole |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

